     * 骞傜瓑鎵ц锛氬幓閲嶈褰曚笌涓氬姟缁撴灉鍚屼簨鍔℃彁浜わ紱鍚?requestId 鍚屽弬鏁拌繑鍥炲師缁撴灉锛?     * 鍚?requestId 涓嶅悓鍙傛暟杩斿洖 409锛涗笟鍔″け璐ユ姏寮傚父鍥炴粴锛屼笉鍗犵敤 requestId銆?     */
    private <T> T idempotent(String requestId, String operation, String paramsHash,
                             Class<T> type, Supplier<T> action) {
        if (requestId == null || requestId.isBlank()) {
            throw ApiException.badRequest("requestId 涓嶈兘涓虹┖");
        }
        Optional<RequestRow> existing = repo.findRequestForUpdate(requestId);
        if (existing.isPresent()) {
